@host = http://localhost:5187

# Story 11: Customer rows are department-scoped; requests run as agentA (Riyadh Customer Care). The persistence baseline
# (Story 02: auditing, value-object round trip, optimistic concurrency) is now shown on the Customers module.
@agentA = 06000000-0000-0000-0003-000000000003

# Story 07: requests run as agent A, signed in below (access tokens expire after 2 minutes in Development -
# re-run the login when a request answers 401). Password: Identity:DevSeed:Password in appsettings.Development.json.
### Login as agent A
# @name loginAgentA
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "agent.a@crm.local", "password": "Crm_Dev_2026!" }

@agentAToken = {{loginAgentA.response.body.accessToken}}

### Create a customer with a contact — 200, echoes createdBy/createdAtUtc
# @name created
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "Round trip", "type": "Individual", "preferredLanguage": "en", "contacts": [{ "name": "Round Trip", "email": "round.trip@example.com" }] }

@customerId = {{created.response.body.customer.id}}

### Read it back — value objects (name, email, phone) and contacts present
# @name readBack
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### Update — populates modifiedBy/modifiedAtUtc, bumps rowVersion.
### rowVersion is a base64 byte[]; send back exactly what the GET returned.
PUT {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "Renamed", "type": "Individual", "preferredLanguage": "en", "rowVersion": "{{readBack.response.body.rowVersion}}" }

### Stale rowVersion — 409, NOT 500
PUT {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers/{{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameEn": "Conflicting", "type": "Individual", "preferredLanguage": "en", "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E=" }

# Soft delete is exercised by organisation.http request 24a (membership removal) — Customers has no delete endpoint
# (merge/delete is post-MVP).

### Arabic value objects round-trip unmangled (name and contact name)
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "displayNameAr": "عميل تجريبي", "type": "Individual", "preferredLanguage": "ar", "contacts": [{ "name": "جهة اتصال", "phone": "+966500000042" }] }

### Canonical query — 200 (Customers are organisation-scoped: agent A sees only RYD-CARE rows)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers?search=Ahmed
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### Validation still returns RFC 9457 with field errors — 400 errors.PageSize
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Customers?pageSize=0
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}
